# Contributing to CalmBridge 🕊️

Thank you for considering a contribution to CalmBridge. This project exists to provide immediate emotional support to people in distress — survivors of disasters, people in mental health crises, and anyone who needs a calm, non-judgmental presence. Every contribution, however small, has the potential to help someone in a vulnerable moment.

Please read this guide carefully before contributing. Our standards are shaped not only by software best practices but by **trauma-informed, culturally sensitive** principles that we hold to a high standard.

