### Accessibility Improvements

CalmBridge targets **WCAG 2.1 AA**. We especially value contributions that improve the experience for:

- Screen reader users (ARIA live regions, focus management)
- Users on low-end devices (performance, bundle size)
- Users with motor impairments (keyboard navigation, touch targets ≥ 44×44px)
- Users in low-bandwidth environments (PWA offline behavior, lazy loading)

When filing accessibility issues, please include: browser, assistive technology (if any), and steps to reproduce.

---

### Bug Fixes & Features

- For bugs: include browser, OS, language setting, and steps to reproduce.
- For features: open an Issue first. Features that change the AI behavior, the safety filter, or the PFA framework implementation require maintainer discussion before implementation.
- All new components must include ARIA labels and keyboard support.
- All new i18n strings must be added to **all four language files** simultaneously.

